  "configuration": "Reusable parser with hard_wrap=True; table, strikethrough, task_lists and URL plugins. Qt renderer maps task states to visible checkbox glyphs. Raw Markdown storage/export stays intact.",
  "inspection": "Wheel metadata, parser factory, HTML renderer, plugin dispatch/task list source and license inspected before installing the pure-Python wheel into the existing local venv; no install script or new service.",
  "alternative": "Qt built-in Markdown collapses soft line breaks and has no hard-wrap option in the current public API; handwritten newline replacement would need to reproduce fenced-code/HTML/list parsing. Mature parser handles those cases directly.",
  "additional_runtime_service": false
